        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The sales representative at the store was very knowledgeable, extremely knowledgeable about her products, and provided excellent advice. The delivery drivers were very professional; they protected the stairs with their mat and took only a few moments to complete everything. Product quality: 10/10, Price: 10/10, Service (store and delivery): 12/10",
